--- !u!114 &169702588
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 169702585}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe16c5afa4916814b86aab10fcf795de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HazardDialogue
  hazardName: OilSpill
  lines:
  - text: Spilled cooking oil is one of the most common fire hazards in a kitchen.
      Grease and oil ignite easily, especially this close to the stove.
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1df00db9a1101574d87e2b5df19761c5, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: If a flame or spark reaches it, the fire can spread across the floor in
      seconds. It's also a slipping hazard for anyone moving around while cooking.
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dabcd07478f38b4384467fb682f154c, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'The rule is simple: good housekeeping. Clean up spills right away and
      keep the cooking area free of grease. Let''s clean this up.'
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2cb2c185d83af914aa26b4c0fb08c86f, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  completionLines:
  - text: Well done. Wiping up spilled oil right away removes the fuel before it
      can ever catch fire.
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dc86be78c176b7249911c3e5eec98bf6, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Keep the cooking area clean at all times \u2014 that's your best defense
      against a grease fire."
    characterPose: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2cb2c185d83af914aa26b4c0fb08c86f, type: 3}
    demoVideo: {fileID: 0}
  actionTarget: {fileID: 227049633}
  isComplete: 0
